{# Tip line of the Feinwerk promotion kit (docs/promo-kit.md): under the plugin's own report, after the feedback question.
   One compact line: the sentence, its link and the hide control; no label, no title (Peter, 2026-11-11). Footer variant A
   (Peter, 2026-11-13, docs/footer.md): always exactly one line, the sentence ends with an ellipsis where it does not fit
   (the full sentence stays in the DOM for screen readers and in the title for hover); link and hide stay visible.
   The banner and the context boxes (templates/_promoBox.twig) keep label and title.
   promo = PromoLine::variables() {id, placement, title, text, link, url, external, note, dismissDays, demo}; hiding for
   30 days and once per page in javascripts/promo.js. A link inside Matomo (the connector in the instance's own
   Marketplace) opens in the same tab; the admin note of the connector message is the link's title (one line).
   The Feinwerk Plugins logo starts the line (Peter, 2026-11-17: "werbung um footer verbessern. feinwerk logo immer
   dabei"), at text height; on a narrow line only its round mark (stylesheets/promo.css).
   promo.linkShort (the connector message): the link's short form for a line too narrow for the full one (Peter,
   2026-11-25: "Kurzer Linktext"; javascripts/promo.js 6), the full text then in the link's title. #}
<div class="fwpromo-line" data-fwpromo-id="{{ promo.id }}" data-fwpromo-placement="line" data-fwpromo-days="{{ promo.dismissDays }}"{% if promo.demo ?? false %} data-fwpromo-demo="1"{% endif %}>
    {% include '@FeinwerkUptimeMonitor/_feinwerkLogo.twig' %}
    <span class="fwpromo-line__text" title="{{ promo.text }}">{{ promo.text }}</span>
    {% set linkShort = promo.linkShort ?? '' %}
    {% set linkTitle = linkShort ? promo.link ~ ((promo.note ?? '') ? '. ' ~ promo.note : '') : (promo.note ?? '') %}
    <a class="fwpromo-line__link" href="{{ promo.url }}"{% if promo.external ?? true %} target="_blank" rel="noopener"{% endif %}{% if linkTitle %} title="{{ linkTitle }}"{% endif %}>{% if linkShort %}<span class="fwpromo-line__link-full">{{ promo.link }}</span><span class="fwpromo-line__link-short">{{ linkShort }}</span>{% else %}{{ promo.link }}{% endif %}</a>
    <button type="button" class="fwpromo-line__dismiss fwpromo-dismiss" title="{{ 'FeinwerkUptimeMonitor_PromoDismiss'|translate }}"
            aria-label="{{ 'FeinwerkUptimeMonitor_PromoDismiss'|translate }}"><span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span></button>
</div>
